          "verses": "1 Samuel 15:1-2",
          "text": "Samuel, the prophet who anointed Saul king, has a message for him: “Now therefore, listen to the words of the LORD.” The LORD of Hosts says He saw what the Amalekites did when they opposed Israel on the way up from Egypt. And friend, He's not done talking."
